Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.00,0:02:34.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,555)\fs50\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(700,0)}Calm Belt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the biggest sea\Nking I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it flipping out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something killed it!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.83,0:03:05.46,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(550,550)\t(505,550,\1a&H00&)\t(5080,5125,\1a&HFF&)}Cheer
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.83,0:03:05.46,Title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(550,550)}Cheer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get a look at what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I like this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a man? Hey! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a doozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark King Silver's relay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember meeting you at Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gold Rogers' first mate\Nright here in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things got kind of rocky in the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ship sank, so I had no\Nchoice but to swim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they never have storms\Nin this part of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they call it the Calm Belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then that must mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He crashed in safe waters and swam\Nthrough that bit of sea kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that supposed to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a pretty good breaststroke. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says it like it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you killed that giant\Nthing with your bare hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have actual bare hands,\Nand I couldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Dark King.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you even sorry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.01,0:04:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me Luffy's on\Nthis island, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess and some others just\Nleft to deliver food to Luffy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.18,0:04:32.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,461)\fs50\bord1.75\c&H1B1B1B&\3c&H1B1B1B&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Center of the Island\N Isle of Women, Amazon Lily
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.18,0:04:32.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,461)\fs50\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(500,0)}Center of the Island\N Isle of Women, Amazon Lily
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make those cheeks of his\Nstretch and stretch and stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard they'll invite him\Nover once all his wounds heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hold a feast again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame he's hurt, but\NI'm glad he came back so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since he's here again, maybe\NI'll make him another pair of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without all the frills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How shameful it is for newlyweds\Nto be separated like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a tragic heroine I've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we're always together in spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how far apart the world may keep\Nus, we are bound by a thread of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always know just what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart is aflame with affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the desire\Nbuilding up inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you, any man\Nmay remember your name,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean that you're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then what is marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else is there to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a difficult question to answer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too weak to travel to Sabo\NOdi especially with that wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to see my friends as soon as\Npossible They'll be expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised them I'd be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well nevertheless
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The submarine is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely they didn't depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Rayleigh, the old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straightforward as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to use my Viva card to go to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sabaody since my friend\Nshould be waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did you see them? I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it seems they\Nhaven't made it there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for my Viva card, I ended\Nup handing it off to Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rather nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can find me, and I\Ncan go wherever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh, I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you must be that former warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to come\Nface-to-face with a living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I suppose you'd like your hat back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head just doesn't\Nfeel right without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, that's a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a group of pirates\Nor a submarine around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about\NTrafalgar Law, he took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He left a message for Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay in bed for two more weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saved your life, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that was a raw deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those women right there\Nand we were stuck on the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what a tease!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said bears were welcome to visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, hey, don't tell us that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the dark king is up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems he's drawn to another\Nman with the will of D!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever happens,\Nit's bound to be a storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why, hello, Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure has been a while.\NHi, Rayleigh. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lovely. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you show some manners for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore the man who saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saved your life so the three\Nof you know old man Rayleigh too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll spare you the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see that you're well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been awake for\Ndays worrying about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've brought plenty of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please eat to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even bear to look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this marriage of\Nyours supposed to work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Serve the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give him some food and be quick about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cornucopia was not meant for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have one bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall endeavor to curb my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need your strength and as\Nthey say to eat is to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done back to the old Luffy already a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A letter from Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing this, Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one bit. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were living in Sabaody\Nagain, it'd be just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you three have gotten tough\Nover the past 13 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possessing a strength that is\Nonly matched by your beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, Granny Magellan, and Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you three,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd still be slaves to the\NCelestial Dragons right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you found him, protecting Luffy\Nmay be more difficult than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're friends, but if\Nyou could find Luffy so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear the Navy's search for him\Nmay prove successful as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'd all be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just now noticed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt the Navy will guess\Nthat Luffy's staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one who helped him\Nescape from the Sabaody
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,archipelago told me he sent\Nhim off in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I work for the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Straw Hat shares a connection\Nwith Dragon, I will let his crew escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's quite the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where did he end up\Nsending our monkey boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.50,0:10:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologized for my abrupt manner earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I speak with you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now as for Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma would only tell me what direction\Nhe sent our friend Luffy flying in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even that info didn't\Nnecessarily point to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent a lot of time\Npuzzling over how Luffy was
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to infiltrate such\Na heavily guarded prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made enough sense that Luffy got there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by stowing away on a\NNavy ship with Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it still didn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hancock is known to hate both\Nthe world government and men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think she'd willingly\Nget on a government ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certainly not to help a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, how else would\NLuffy have gotten there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you considered this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Hancock met Monkey and had\Na case of love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, everything fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is pretty cute, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's also a lovely way\Nto spite the Navy and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now she's got the perfect\Nopportunity to nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her poor, injured lover\Nboy back to health.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're letting your\Nimagination get carried away, Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that's the power\Nof women's intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The snake princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see for yourself. Do\Nyou like it? Please say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although our little theory turned out to\Nbe true, it's still pretty ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Navy won't act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time we\Ngot down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier you said you're heading back\Nto Sabaody to meet up with your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you still plan on doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they do, but is\Nthat the best choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you remember how your\Nlast trip to Sabahodi ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, start running\Nand look after yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't win this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you are right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think you would fare any better\Nif you were to face those enemies again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be reunited with your\Nfriends only to endure the same fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would imagine that your answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me offer you some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do with it what you will.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.60,0:14:22.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,488)\fs50\bord1.9\c&H1B1B1B&\3c&H1B1B1B&\blur0.6}Grand Line\NBowin Archipelago
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.60,0:14:22.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,488)\fs50\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6}Grand Line\NBowin Archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on the Bowen\NIslands, on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, Usoppun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp seems to be moving his massive body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which has grown huge from eating\Nan abundant variety of food?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the gorging forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some might call it running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep trying till I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, you big oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Usoppun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you heed my warnings? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time you try to\Nget off of the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrifying creatures like the giant\Nbeetle will stand in your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and force you back into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to stop you from entering\Nthe island, but then your fate is sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you can learn to\Nsurvive in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one ever leaves this island alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, my name is Hercules!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Usoppun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea creature in has just\Ncrawled onto the Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usoppun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sweet flavors and intoxicating aromas\Nthat emanate from the Bowen Islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attract a plethora of\Ngiant insects and birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even sea kings and other aquatic\Nanimals visit from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your sea hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to stop and stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wonderful smells lead\Nthem deeper onto the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, they find ever\Nmore tempting flavors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But while it's easy to enter the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's much harder to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try my exploding star!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of here\Nno matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare get on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.14,0:17:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The islands are gonna move again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, do what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab a tree and hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How often does this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time it needs to feed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The so-called Bowen Islands are\Nnot at all what they appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flower-shaped island is actually an
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,island-sized flower known\Nas the Stomach Berry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What has gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since the news coup brought that\Npaper, you've been acting like a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've wasted enough time\Non this stupid island!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, he lost his brother in the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, he doesn't know where\Nwe are or if we're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy wouldn't let me suffer like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm his friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be there for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.33,0:19:18.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,546)\fs50\c&H1B1B1B&\3c&H1B1B1B&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(700,0)\t(655,700,\1a&H00&)}Torino Kingdom
Dialogue: 2,0:19:14.33,0:19:18.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,546)\fs50\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(700,0)}Torino Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We not long ago make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon really leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I read that newspaper and found\Nout what my friend's been going through,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized I couldn't\Nstick around any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had just met Luffy's\Nbrother in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he needs medical attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always pushes himself\Nway too hard. Good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's good to see you and the\Nbirds are getting along better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understanding only happened because brave\Nraccoon friend risking life to do talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys remember not to pick\Nfights with the humans, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want you to let them pick\Nthe plants that grow on that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon, speaking truth, we\Nno fight you are taking eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We not same as bad humans that stealing\Nyour treasure and chase you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.22,0:20:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was really impressed with that medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys gave me when\NI got injured before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.98,0:20:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I'm better already. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We using special medicine recipe we\Npassing down over many generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could stay here with you guys\Nand study those plants for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's still a lot I could learn,\Nbut the timing's kind of bad right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always welcome here, Raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After my friends and I find each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell them all about\Nthis amazing place I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise, when I can,\NI'll come back and visit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Journey long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe get hungry. Oh, wow. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See Raccoon soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love cotton candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be nice to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You travel soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've got a yummy lunch\Nand all the cotton candy I can eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to head for the\Nmeeting spot so I can help Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just realized I don't\Nhave a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woohoo! Lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of\Nthis in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in no time flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so fast, Mr. Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, News Coo, I'll take one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can read this while I have my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should have some new\Ninfo about the war by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.89,0:22:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Gloom Island on the Grand Line,\Nhome to the ruins of the Monkey Kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.74,0:22:17.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,575)\fs50\bord1.8\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(800,900)\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)\t(4470,4515,\1a&HFF&)}Gloom Island
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.74,0:22:17.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,575)\fs50\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(800,900)}Gloom Island
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An old castle remains\Nfrom the long-dead empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.48,0:22:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite its age, a well-known\Nfigure has made the castle his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Mario have to get himself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being a pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and cry somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so heartless\Nwhen I'm grieving?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some compassion, you big Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything kind to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offer me a tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.14,0:22:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.36,0:22:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your manners are appalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never invited you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you showed up and\Nstarted living here without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, this article\Nis not credible. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But does that mean Moria\Ncould still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.92,0:23:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good question, now you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he died, then I didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.12,0:23:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, if he did escape, then I\Ndidn't see that either, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you think he might have survived and\Nthey're lying about it for some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.50,0:23:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fix that with your spits!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who even taught you that\Ngarbage, your grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may be stupid, but\Ndamn, they're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.46,0:23:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'm never\Ngoing to make it to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawk Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while since you left the\Ncastle, yet you've only made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.51,0:24:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the boat I offered you, it\Nseems it's not seaworthy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.16,0:24:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could just hold on to a\Nfew planks and swim there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.68,0:24:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not one to give up\Nthat easily, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.04,0:24:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sentiment is admirable,\Nbut you can't defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're called humandrills, baboons that\Ndevelop by imitating human behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humandrills?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had they grown up among peace-loving humans,\Nthey would have turned out differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.70,0:24:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.74,0:24:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until seven years ago, this\Nwas the site of a great war.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first came here to live, the entire\Nisland still smelled of blood and smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.90,0:24:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everywhere, dead bodies\Nlittered the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.28,0:24:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the battles raged on,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.04,0:25:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these baboons watched the violence\Nbetween the humans unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.36,0:25:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In time, they learned how to\Nuse human weapons and armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,becoming warriors of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans can defeat ordinary animals\Nby using weapons and intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.08,0:25:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what happens when\Nanimals don weapons as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.44,0:25:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, they make formidable\Nopponents for an arrogant young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.80,0:25:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's leave. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.18,0:25:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that your mandrels won't\Nset foot near the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got no right\Ntelling me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.56,0:25:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to make it to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.68,0:25:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.94,0:25:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.58,0:25:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if they're\Nforest warriors or monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.72,0:25:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already wasted enough\Ntime stranded in this dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.18,0:25:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on the floating\Nisland of Weatheria,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world's foremost meteorologists are\Nbusy coping with a most unruly guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.22,0:26:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give back what I borrowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me out of this\Nstupid bubble jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.76,0:26:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horridus!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.67,0:26:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get Horridus, and he'll sort this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.58,0:26:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gritty, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.58,0:26:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're old and you're scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what kind of\Ntrap you're plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.72,0:26:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a place of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be punished for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what if we shocked\Nher or drowned her a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.72,0:26:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which better befits a thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.06,0:26:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you guys got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, let me out, at\Nleast give me a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.24,0:26:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, Missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.98,0:26:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what a pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, young lady. Hey yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.22,0:27:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another outburst.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.62,0:27:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just weren't made to\Ntake it easy, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.82,0:27:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember this fellow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.24,0:27:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll show you a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.82,0:27:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your tightly tied wind knots like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.86,0:27:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah, snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.98,0:27:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was counting on you to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.06,0:27:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.30,0:27:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in a rush, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.76,0:27:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard enough speak to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us you're not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.08,0:27:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.30,0:27:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.66,0:27:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hit that kind and gentle\Nman! What a beast! Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone call the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.06,0:27:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's most curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.60,0:27:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she stole an armful of weather\Nballs in our research notes,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.30,0:27:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which then tried to make a break for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.72,0:27:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.38,0:28:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the little thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got to make a living somehow, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.74,0:28:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply reprehensible,\Nsuch an awful human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.04,0:28:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no villain in our midst.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.88,0:28:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.88,0:28:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't want me here,\Nand I don't want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.68,0:28:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got back everything I stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.42,0:28:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.04,0:28:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop flipping out for\Nfive seconds and listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.12,0:28:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.92,0:28:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.46,0:28:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's terribly violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.76,0:28:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.40,0:28:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I should tell you, stealing a\Nballoon was both foolish and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need proper training to pilot one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.02,0:28:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have easily died.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.72,0:28:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The paper, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.62,0:28:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that article about\Nthe pirate named Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.66,0:29:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the captain of our ship. Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've seen that fellow before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.24,0:29:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy's a real upstart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.88,0:29:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caused quite the ruckus\Nin Marineford, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.28,0:29:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's famous for that\NStraw Hat that he wears.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.62,0:29:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our crew has been\Nseparated for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.96,0:29:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he doesn't even know\Nif we're alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.06,0:29:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea what he was going\Nthrough until I read that paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.82,0:29:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been taking it easy all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.98,0:29:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while he was down there\Nfighting for his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw his brother killed\Nright before his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.76,0:29:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.48,0:29:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.16,0:29:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.40,0:29:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and for the rest of the crew, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.66,0:29:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is strong, but\Nthis is too much to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.46,0:29:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be there for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! Don't cry. You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.82,0:30:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.56,0:30:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the real villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.87,0:30:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, abducting an innocent\Nyoung girl and making her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.28,0:30:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give Harados the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.48,0:30:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.38,0:30:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sort this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.38,0:30:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.29,0:30:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.21,0:30:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see Harados either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.62,0:30:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.53,0:30:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did she move so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.10,0:30:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye! Huh? Bye-bye?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.40,0:30:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She pretended to cry to\Ntake Horridus hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she's stealing our stuff again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world below isn't ready for the\Ngenius of our research! I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:30:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.66,0:31:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.57,0:31:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it by myself! Impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.42,0:31:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.62,0:31:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.90,0:31:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry every time\Nwe've been in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.14,0:31:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been there to\Nhelp us just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.82,0:31:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we can return the favor
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.80,0:31:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already captured me young lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't need to pretend\Nto cry like that anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.66,0:31:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now return to Futureland, Baldimore,\Na mechanical island where the genius, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.16,0:31:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk, was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have an intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's broken into Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.14,0:31:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apprehend them, but\Ndon't use any firearms!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.62,0:31:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His inventions are too valuable!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.12,0:31:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to have even one damaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.10,0:31:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood? Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.86,0:32:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.70,0:32:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, it must have tightened security\Nafter the last time I broke in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.18,0:32:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't shoot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.72,0:32:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean the\Nlab is full of treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.56,0:32:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk is the head of the Navy Science\NDivision, so all of his works are valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Priceless, Brittany.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.62,0:32:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our country is very proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I suppose it's his\Nmind that's the real treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.92,0:32:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, he spent his youth\Nworking in that lab, tirelessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.96,0:32:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed that mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rather unnatural shape, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.02,0:32:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never gave it much thought, but\Nyeah, there's a story behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.96,0:32:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a project Vegapunk began as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was meant to protect the\Nisland's people from frigid weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.92,0:32:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He built it by transforming the animals\Nin the forest into a robotic workforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.24,0:32:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it remains unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.76,0:33:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sort of geothermal system\Nto heat up the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.24,0:33:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world just can't keep\Nup with his imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.62,0:33:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why so many of his works remain\Nburied here in a state of half-completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.50,0:33:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, the technology or\Nfunds he needed didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.10,0:33:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he couldn't get rid\Nof the cold, knowing that he
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cared knowing that he worked so\Nhard warmed our hearts at least
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.70,0:33:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that story is super depressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.24,0:33:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the people here are\Nhappy to wait for his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.22,0:33:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever that may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.56,0:33:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please respect our feelings\Nand stay out of that lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.52,0:33:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it's equipped with a self-destruct\Nbutton, in case you wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.88,0:33:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.94,0:33:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.06,0:33:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why did you think\NI would want to know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I was going to press the dumb thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, that sounds pretty scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.38,0:34:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we forget about\Nthis whole mess and go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you some nice hot tea, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kiddo. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.98,0:34:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't come all the way out here\Nwith no pants on just to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.50,0:34:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting that icebreaker\Nif it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't get me wrong i appreciate\Nyour hospitality but i read
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.26,0:34:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the paper today and it turns\Nout that my captain has gone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.26,0:34:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through hell and back so bye\Nyou guys have a nice life i know
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.34,0:34:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's tempting but no matter what\Ndon't press that self-destruct
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,button would you give it a rest\Nalready why the hell would i
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to do something like that i\Ncan't believe the doctor cooked
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.56,0:34:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up all this stuff when he was\Nso young because this is super
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.26,0:34:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brilliant work if i've ever seen\Nit half of this is so advanced
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.92,0:34:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll take another hundred\Nyears before the world is ready
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.28,0:34:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe i don't want to mess with\Nthis as a fellow engineer i
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gotta respect the man's work\Ndid you hear the marines came by
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.84,0:34:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and said someone broke into the\Nlab that's not good let's just
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.98,0:35:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hope they catch him they're\Nprobably looking to sell stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.60,0:35:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the black market even a\Nblueprint from that place would be
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.12,0:35:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worth a fortune but someone just\Nsneeze on one of dr vega punk's
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.14,0:35:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,masterpieces and you'll spend\Nthe rest of your life in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.74,0:35:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.42,0:35:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.46,0:35:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.37,0:35:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a pirate mark, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.58,0:35:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.70,0:35:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, hypothetically, if by some crazy\Nchance I press that button like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.36,0:35:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.90,0:35:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't, like, hold\Nit against me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.82,0:35:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we would!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.36,0:35:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,News of this incident quickly\Nspread across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.58,0:35:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And history would remember\Nit as Baltimore's nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.30,0:36:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're truly a blessing from hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.30,0:36:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.76,0:36:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.74,0:36:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that one day we'd\Nbe able to fight back like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much less beat them\Nand put them in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.78,0:36:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music, something about it changed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.18,0:36:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt so uplifted\Nbefore. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.34,0:36:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Courage and strength\Nwelled up in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.56,0:36:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stood up and defended ourselves\Nfor the first time in our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, we had no idea\Nhow to use our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.94,0:36:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, you did most of the\Nactual fighting by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.02,0:36:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.94,0:36:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What matters is the people who\Nwere abducted came back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.30,0:36:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're too modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.02,0:36:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only helped a teeny bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.42,0:36:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither gods nor devils will help\Nthose who won't fight on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.28,0:36:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In times like these, it is important\Nto stand resolute against evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.10,0:36:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if the odds seem insurmountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.04,0:36:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.44,0:36:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You prove that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.68,0:36:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a wise god!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.24,0:36:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've inspired us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.92,0:37:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best to make you proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.94,0:37:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your teachings!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.98,0:37:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail Lord Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that repaid their kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.18,0:37:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't believe the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.22,0:37:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stay strong Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.34,0:37:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.00,0:37:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon to share in your grief
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.14,0:37:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had a heart it would be heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.92,0:37:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I can return to your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.78,0:37:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can do is play a song and\Nhope that it reaches you somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.04,0:37:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they got the\Ndevil as their bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.46,0:37:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an embarrassment They\Nshould be the ones in cages with
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.54,0:37:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those freakish single-jointed arms\Nof theirs on display Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.64,0:37:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can make a lot of money doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.38,0:37:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.56,0:37:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.14,0:37:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll put their freakish\Ndouble-jointed arms on display.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.80,0:37:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They owe us, and we can certainly\Nmake a lot of money doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.34,0:37:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.46,0:37:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.60,0:37:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that you didn't appreciate\Nit when they were cruel to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.70,0:37:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.76,0:38:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.10,0:38:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could we, Lord Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.76,0:38:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll just come back\Nand attack us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.88,0:38:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.16,0:38:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of that by\Nbinding them to a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.64,0:38:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contract. Heed my words well. If you break\Nyour oath with me and commit a wrongful
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,act against the people in this country\Nagain I will hunt each of you down
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.56,0:38:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I will eat your heart thank
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.96,0:38:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sir we promise you will behave we're
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.92,0:38:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going straight back to our homes we'll\Nnever come back again oh please don't hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.70,0:38:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us sorry but we don't believe in curses\Noh also your speech was stupid and
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you fell for the oldest trick in the\Nbook if we bring back an actual walking
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.36,0:38:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking skeleton, we can make a whole\Nton of money. Wait a minute, let me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.76,0:39:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go i have somewhere i need to be oh\Nno we have an emergency lord satan has
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.44,0:39:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just been kidnapped everyone prepare\Nto summon another devil and fast yes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.22,0:39:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can still summon devils with the
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.94,0:39:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magical power of underwear luffy when
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.06,0:39:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel sad? Just sing a song. Music\Nis meant to make you happy, so sing as.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.66,0:39:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wait for me i'll try to no i will
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.52,0:39:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be there until then if you can hear me

